\\\"above the stars.\\\"\\n\\n## Chosen methodology\\n- Mover's Odyssey tendon-first system (his two YouTube videos): isometrics (incl. maximal-effort isometrics per 57% study), repetitive eccentrics, plyometrics last. Kung Fu tendon philosophy. Light body + strong tendons = highest power-to-weight. He connected strongly with this.\\n\\n## Structure agreed\\n- Gamified \\\"missions\\\" layer (RPG fitness) — story-driven sessions, garden as the map. Training hidden inside missions, not the reverse.\\n- Weapons: heavy metal bar for mace swings + spear throwing; chain for climbing; rubber bands; hole-riddled walls as terrain. Live fighting skill requires a gym — not accessible now; build the chassis solo, bolt on skill later.\\n- Garden inventory: tree branches, thick bar (can't close hand around), heavy metal bar, rubber bands various sizes, walls big/small + with holes, chain. Low budget.\\n- No accessible clubs: parkour/MMA/wrestling ~2h away, different state, night training, can't get home in time + family issues.\\n\\n## Current stage\\n- CRITICAL RULE: do NOT construct any workout plan until he explicitly asks. Step-by-step, carefully measured, no haste.\\n- Awaiting 3-day assessment results: Day1 (max dead hang, max pull-ups, horse stance hold, max push-ups), Day2 (broad jump best of 3, pistols/side, eyes-closed single-leg stand, overhead deep squat notes), Day3 (2km time trial @80%, morning resting HR x3 avg).\\n- Next when data arrives: analyze gaps vs old numbers, then on his signal build mission-based tendon-first programming.\",\"mode\":\"replace\",\"path\":\"persist/mouha_profile.md\"}}\n\n\n[Tool result for call_368f394e_0]: workspace_write_file: Wrote 2302 chars / 339 words to persist/mouha_profile.md.","stream":true,"captcha_verify_param":"eyJjZXJ0aWZ5SWQiOiJFeDEzcDBNRzAwIiwiaXNTaWduIjp0cnVlLCJzY2VuZUlkIjoiZGlkazMzZTAiLCJzZWN1cml0eVRva2VuIjoiNm9PbzdlNzJuQTYxdVZMaVpWS2lMWXFGMW05ck9ubzN2RUlQSkthTDdLTHhDSnFiMVVCd1JwbDRwN0VjRlRnZEZTTGg4QjRscUVYQmRBSGRUZ2x0e